    "updated_at": "2025-09-04T04:33:33Z",
    "body": "> defaulting crossorigin to \"anonymous\" (instead of No-cors).\n\nCan you say more about why we'd want to depart from HTML's usual behavior here? This seems a bit worrying, as it makes `crossorigin=\"\"` for this element behave differently than it does for every other element.",
