    "updated_at": "2025-09-09T15:23:31Z",
    "body": "I think we have precedent for this actually, https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/links.html#link-type-manifest appears to do this as well, unless I'm misreading. It might even be kind of reasonable given that we don't really want new no-CORS fetches, but it is rather inconsistent.",
