    "updated_at": "2025-09-10T01:12:24Z",
    "body": "Oh, you're right. The end result is the same, although the underlying spec mechanisms are quite different. (Since compression-dictionary reuses \"create a link request\" whereas manifest does a custom request creation.)\n\nGreat, I'm fine with this then.",
